  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing livelihoods work in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides funding for CAFOD&apos;s strategic Colombia partner SNPS/Caritas Colombia to employ a livelihoods adviser to provide advice and support to livelihoods projects implemented by SNPS, primarily the small businesses in southern Colombia set up under the EU-funded AIPODE project and the businesses to be established under the Non-State Actors programme implemented by SNPS with the support of CAFOD.</narrative>
  </description>
